          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ожидать (ozhidát) — \"to expect, to await\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Мы не ожидали такого результата. My ne ozhidáli takógo rezultáta. We did not expect such a result."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective. It takes the genitive or the accusative: ожидать (ozhidát) ответа. More formal than ждать."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ожидать (ozhidát) is built from о- and -жидать, the long shape of the root of ждать \"to wait\" (as -бирать stands beside брать); ждать is inherited from Proto-Slavic žĭdati \"to wait, to await\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
