          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "получаться (poluchátsya) is the reflexive of получать, from по- and лучать, from лучить \"to come upon\", Proto-Slavic lučiti, tentatively \"to find, to reach\" (EtymDB): what you come upon in the end."
            }
          ]
